# Test PractiMatch Waitlist API
### Root endpoint
### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
### Register new user in waitlist (Student)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "user_type": "student",
  "product_of_interest": "PractiMatch Platform",
  "source": "Instagram",
  "country": "Mexico"
}

### Register duplicate email (should increment counter)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "user_type": "student",
  "product_of_interest": "PractiMatch Platform",
  "source": "Facebook",
  "country": "Mexico"
}

### Register company
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "company@example.com",
  "user_type": "company",
  "product_of_interest": "Recruitment Tool",
  "source": "Direct"
}

### Register university (without optional fields)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "university@example.com",
  "user_type": "university",
  "product_of_interest": "Academic Partnership"

}

